Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

As of v0.0 this repository vendors no third-party source.

From v0.5 onward it will vendor components from Kronos
(https://github.com/shiyu-coder/Kronos), Copyright (c) shiyu-coder,
licensed under the MIT License. Specifically: the BSQuantizer and the
tokenizer encoder/decoder (v0.5), and the autoregressive decoder in
model/kronos.py (v0.7). The Kronos copyright notice and license text will
be reproduced in this file alongside the vendored sources at that time.

This placeholder exists so the attribution obligation is recorded on day
one rather than discovered at vendoring time.
